page: document
  title 'UI described as links'
  page-title: heading
    level 1
    text 'UI described as links'
  page-lead: paragraph
    text 'Every element, style and animation is a Links Notation link. Links UI interprets a network of links at runtime, with a plain JavaScript core and thin platform renderers.'
  section-title: heading
    level 2
    text 'Start with a document'
  block-0: code-block
    text 'npm install @link-foundation/ui-core @link-foundation/ui-dom @link-foundation/ui-store'
  block-1: paragraph
    text 'Write a LiNo document, then call mountDocument(container, text). Inspect this site with Alt+Shift+D or ?ui-dev.'
  block-2: link
    label 'Get started'
    href getting-started/
